    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d918">

                <pb facs="0867" n="777" xml:id="pg777"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 760d.62/l</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of
                            State to the Minister in Sweden</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                    >Morris</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1918-12-21T15:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">December 21,
                                1918, 3 p.m.</hi></date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1392. Your despatch 1492, dated November 18, 1918. Was secret agreement ever
                    accepted by Finland? Also, how long was it to remain in force?</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >Polk</hi></signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
